flowchart TD
    Run["LangChainAdapter.run / LangGraphAdapter.run"] --> Resolve["Resolve runnable or candidate factory"]
    Resolve --> Input["Map EvaluationExample to framework input"]
    Input --> Config["Map Candidate to configurable namespace"]
    Config --> Invoke["Await runnable.ainvoke with input and config"]
